flowchart LR
    Browser[Controller browser / existing demo page] -->|HTTPS, user JWT| Nginx[Nginx edge and static assets]
    Nginx -->|/api/v1/** only| Gateway[Gateway MVC<br/>JWT validation, route and role policy<br/>no business database]
    Nginx -->|static pages/assets| Static[Existing demo + local/test auth harness]

    Gateway -->|/api/v1/ingestion/**| Ingestion[Ingestion<br/>poll, normalize, topology, demo]
    Gateway -->|/api/v1/disruption/**| Disruption[Disruption<br/>bunching + traffic lifecycle]
    Gateway -->|/api/v1/planning/**| Planning[Planning<br/>diagnosis + recommendation]

    Disruption -->|private capability: arrival, traffic, topology, demo reads| Ingestion
    Disruption -->|durable outbox / private capability| Planning
    Planning -->|private capability: existing context and topology| Ingestion

    Ingestion -->|schema owner/runtime role| DB[(PostgreSQL + PostGIS)]
    Disruption -->|schema owner/runtime role| DB
    Planning -->|schema owner/runtime role| DB

    DataMall[DataMall provider] -->|poll| Ingestion
    Gemini[Gemini provider] <-->|bounded model request| Planning
    Supabase[Supabase Auth<br/>issuer + public JWKS] -->|sign-in and public keys| Browser
    Gateway -.->|issuer/JWKS validation| Supabase
    Ingestion -.->|provider HTTP egress| Internet[Outbound network]
    Planning -.->|provider HTTP egress| Internet

    subgraph IngestionRuntime[Ingestion process]
      Ingestion
    end
    subgraph DisruptionRuntime[Disruption process]
      BunchingPolicy[Bunching policy]
      TrafficPolicy[Traffic lifecycle policy]
      BunchingPolicy --> Disruption
      TrafficPolicy --> Disruption
    end
    subgraph PlanningRuntime[Planning process]
      Diagnosis[Diagnosis policy/model]
      Recommendation[Recommendation policy/model]
      Diagnosis -->|local domain call + durable job| Recommendation
      Diagnosis --> Planning
      Recommendation --> Planning
    end

    classDef public fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#3973ac;
    classDef private fill:#ecfbf2,stroke:#338652;
    classDef deferred fill:#f6f6f6,stroke:#888;
    class Gateway,Nginx public;
    class Ingestion,Disruption,Planning,DB private;
